<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Telecel shares hit all-time high.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Telecel shares hit all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Portuguese mobile phone operator Telecel hit an all-time high of 12,550 escudos on Lisbon bourse and could test even higher levels, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The next objective is 12,600 escudos,&quot; said one operator.</p>
<p>Another said: &quot;There are buyers, mainly foreign investors, and there are few sellers, and so there is a surge in the stock.&quot;</p>
<p>Dealers said the market was pleased with Telecel's results and optimistic about the company's performance.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
